<p><a href="https://newhorizonathlone.org/">https://newhorizonathlone.org/</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Meanwhile, Moate residents had more cause to celebrate last year when a long-sought after playground opened in Mount Carmel Drive. Our report on how volunteers made it happen with support from Westmeath Community Development:</strong></p>
<blockquote><p><a href="https://changingireland.ie/westmeath-community-shows-that-getting-a-new-playground-was-no-childs-play/">Westmeath community shows that getting a new playground was no child&#8217;s play</a></p></blockquote>
<p><iframe sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" title="“Westmeath community shows that getting a new playground was no child’s play” — Changing Ireland" src="https://changingireland.ie/westmeath-community-shows-that-getting-a-new-playground-was-no-childs-play/embed/#?secret=Bm23LJD2Wx#?secret=naoLFYN1c2" width="600" height="338" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p>', 'Dún na Sí Amenity and Heritage Park is a true community endeavour – what was once a cow park has become one of Westmeath’s and the Midlands’ most popular visitor attractions. An hour from Galway and 75 minutes from Dublin, it rates highly on Tripadvisor. Remarkably, the park which opened in 2015 is run by a dedicated community group and over 100 volunteers play their part annually – alongside staff – to keep the park running smoothly. KATHY MASTERSON spoke to three people deeply involved in the…', 'https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Moates-Dun-na-Si-Lughs-sword-2.jpg', '', '[{"slug":"community","title":"Community"},{"slug":"enterprise","title":"Enterprise"}]', '[{"slug":"community-centre-investment-fund-ccif","title":"Community Centre Investment Fund (CCIF)"},{"slug":"community-employment","title":"Community Employment"},{"slug":"community-services-programme","title":"Community Services Programme"},{"slug":"leader","title":"LEADER"},{"slug":"moate","title":"Moate"},{"slug":"westmeath-community-development","title":"Westmeath Community Development"},{"slug":"westmeath-county-council","title":"Westmeath County Council"}]', '', 252495, 1, '2023-01-23T16:33:19Z', '2023-02-10T11:11:36Z', '2023-01-23T16:33:19Z')
