<p>&nbsp;</p>', '30 groups from Mayo, Tipperary and Limerick upskilled during two-year ‘Co-operating to Succeed’ initiative', 'https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Co-operating-to-Succeed-social-enterprise-main-pic.jpg', '', '[{"slug":"community","title":"Community"}]', '[{"slug":"leader","title":"LEADER"},{"slug":"limerick","title":"Limerick"},{"slug":"mayo","title":"Mayo"},{"slug":"sicap-social-inclusion-community-activation-programme","title":"SICAP"},{"slug":"social-enterprise","title":"social enterprise"},{"slug":"south-tipperary-development","title":"South Tipperary Development"},{"slug":"south-west-mayo-development","title":"South West Mayo Development"},{"slug":"tipperary","title":"Tipperary"},{"slug":"west-limerick-resources","title":"West Limerick Resources"}]', '', 252409, 1, '2022-11-03T10:00:34Z', '2022-11-03T15:27:17Z', '2022-11-03T10:00:34Z')
