<p>*County Cork includes three sub-regional areas of North Cork, South Cork and West Cork, the allocation indicated will be distributed across the three sub-regional areas.</p>', 'Minister for Rural and Community Development, Heather Humphreys, has today announced the details of the €180 million LEADER Programme for 2023-2027.', 'https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Minister-Heather-Humphreys-speaking.png', '', '[{"slug":"funding","title":"Funding"}]', '[]', '', 252381, 1, '2022-10-27T11:16:22Z', '2022-10-27T11:16:22Z', '2022-10-27T11:16:22Z')
